{'symbol': 'LYV', 'date': '2022-08-05 12:15:00', 'title': 'MEMBERS OF THIRD EYE BLIND SHARE FIRST CAR MEMORIES', 'text': 'MERCURY INSURANCE\'S \'MY FIRST CAR\' TAKES AN INTIMATE LOOK AT MUSIC ARTISTS\' FIRST RIDES THIRD EYE BLIND HEADLINES SHOW AT THE FIVEPOINT AMPHITHEATRE IN IRVINE, CA SATURDAY (8/13) LOS ANGELES , AUG. 5, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MERCURY INSURANCE (NYSE: MCY) AND LIVE NATION HAVE PARTNERED UP AGAIN TO HELP CONNECT MUSIC FANS WITH THE ARTISTS THEY LOVE THROUGH THE CREATION OF MERCURY\'S "MY FIRST CAR" SERIES, WHICH PROVIDES AN INSIDE LOOK AT ARTISTS\' FOND MEMORIES AND FIRSTS BEHIND THE WHEEL. "THERE ARE SOME COMMON EXPERIENCES IN LIFE THAT CAN BRIDGE THE PERSONAL CONNECTION BETWEEN ARTISTS AND FANS AND ONE OF THEM IS OWNING YOUR FIRST CAR," SAID ERIK THOMPSON, VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF MARKETING OFFICER AT MERCURY INSURANCE.'}